# In-Tour Operations (ITO-001)

**Purpose:** Operator day-of execution desk inside tour workspace — real manifest, payment/insurance projection, attendance integration, groups, checklists, operational incidents, and member-visible schedule/location changes via shared notification outbox.

---

## 1. Scope

| In scope | Out of scope |
| -------- | ------------ |
| Execution state machine per tour | Post-tour finance settlement |
| Manifest snapshot from approved registrations | Transport route optimization |
| Group + group-leader assignment | New notification platform |
| Pre / during / post checklists | Emergency SOS / safety dispatch (product gate) |
| Operational event log | Rewriting attendance producer |
| Controlled schedule/location/leader changes + SDE fan-out | Big-bang refactor of bookings Command Center |

---

## 2. Actors and permissions

| Actor | Read execution | Lock manifest | Transition state | Groups/checklists | Operational events | Schedule/location/leader change | Mark attendance |
| ----- | -------------- | ------------- | ---------------- | ----------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------- | --------------- |
| owner / admin | yes | yes | yes | yes | yes | yes | yes (all) |
| tour leader (assigned `tourLeaderUserId`) | yes | no | yes (pre→completed) | yes | yes | yes | yes (all) |
| group leader (assigned on group) | yes | no | no | group-scoped checklist | report only | no | group members only |
| viewer | yes | no | no | no | no | no | no |
| member (portal) | own row + tour summary | no | no | no | no | no | no |

Authorization uses existing operator session roles plus contextual assignment on execution/group rows.

---

## 3. Execution state machine

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft
  draft --> manifest_locked: lockManifest
  manifest_locked --> pre_tour: openPreTour
  pre_tour --> in_progress: startTour
  in_progress --> post_tour: endTourMovement
  post_tour --> completed: completeTour
  draft --> cancelled: cancel
  manifest_locked --> cancelled: cancel
  pre_tour --> cancelled: cancel
  in_progress --> cancelled: cancel
  post_tour --> cancelled: cancel
  completed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
```

| State | Meaning |
| ----- | ------- |
| `draft` | Execution record exists; manifest editable from live approved registrations |
| `manifest_locked` | Snapshot frozen; roster counts stable for day-of |
| `pre_tour` | Pre-tour checklist active |
| `in_progress` | Tour running — attendance + operational events |
| `post_tour` | Post-tour checklist |
| `completed` | Terminal success |
| `cancelled` | Terminal cancel |

Optimistic concurrency: `rowVersion` on `tour_executions`; stale PATCH → `409 TOUR_EXECUTION_VERSION_CONFLICT`.

---

## 4. Persistence

### 4.1 Tables (tenant-scoped, FORCE RLS)

| Table | Purpose |
| ----- | ------- |
| `tour_executions` | One row per tour per execution cycle (unique `tenant_id,tour_id` while non-terminal) |
| `tour_execution_manifest_rows` | Frozen participant projection |
| `tour_execution_groups` | Named groups + optional `leader_user_id` |
| `tour_execution_checklist_items` | Phase `pre` \| `during` \| `post` |
| `tour_execution_operational_events` | Incidents / notes |
| `tour_execution_change_logs` | Append-only audit for schedule/location/leader corrections |

Manifest row projection:

| Field | Source |
| ----- | ------ |
| `registration_status` | `operator_registrations.status` at lock |
| `payment_status` | `operator_registrations.payment_status` |
| `insurance_status` | Derived from `registration_intake` (`insuranceStatus`, `insuranceProvided`, `insuranceConfirmed`) |
| `attendance_status` | Live join to `operator_registrations.attendance_status` after lock |
| `group_id` | Assignment |

Attendance corrections continue via `POST /bookings/:id/attendance` (DP-7); manifest displays live attendance columns.

---

## 5. HTTP API (operator)

Base: `/tours/:tourId/execution`

| Method | Path | Action |
| ------ | ---- | ------ |
| GET | `/tours/:tourId/execution` | Get or bootstrap draft execution + manifest preview |
| POST | `/tours/:tourId/execution/manifest/lock` | Lock manifest from approved registrations |
| PATCH | `/tours/:tourId/execution/state` | Transition state (`expectedVersion`) |
| PUT | `/tours/:tourId/execution/groups` | Replace group set |
| PATCH | `/tours/:tourId/execution/manifest/:registrationId/group` | Assign manifest row to group |
| PUT | `/tours/:tourId/execution/checklist` | Upsert checklist items |
| PATCH | `/tours/:tourId/execution/checklist/:itemId` | Toggle complete |
| POST | `/tours/:tourId/execution/operational-events` | Log operational event |
| PATCH | `/tours/:tourId/execution/schedule` | Change meeting time (outbox) |
| PATCH | `/tours/:tourId/execution/location` | Change meeting location (outbox) |
| PATCH | `/tours/:tourId/execution/tour-leader` | Assign tour leader |

Member read: `GET /member/tours/:tourId/execution-summary` — approved registration required.

---

## 6. Outbox events (SDE-001)

| Canonical `eventType` | When | Notification template |
| --------------------- | ---- | --------------------- |
| `tour.execution.started` | `in_progress` transition | `tour.execution.started` |
| `tour.execution.completed` | `completed` transition | `tour.execution.completed` |
| `tour.execution.change.notified` | schedule / location / tour-leader PATCH | `tour.execution.change.notified` |

Payload includes `tourId`, `executionId`, `changeKind`, `previousValue`, `newValue`, `actorUserId`.

Dispatcher: `dispatchTourExecutionNotificationFromOutbox` — fans out to approved registration members (same pattern as `tour.schedule.changed`).

---

## 7. Operator UI

Tour workspace tab **`operations`** (`?tab=operations`):

- State banner + transition actions (permission-gated)
- Manifest table: guest, party, approval, payment, insurance, attendance, group
- Groups panel + leader pickers
- Checklist accordion (pre / during / post)
- Operational events timeline
- Change forms: meeting time, location, tour leader

States: loading, empty (no approved registrations), error, forbidden (viewer).

Locales: EN + FA RTL; mobile stacked layout.

---

## 8. Member Home / portal

Registration detail + home quick status chip:

- Execution state label
- Meeting time/location when manifest locked+
- Unread `tour.execution.change.notified` links to inbox

---

## 9. Tests

| Layer | Suite |
| ----- | ----- |
| Postgres | `tour-execution.postgres.spec.ts` — ITO-P01..P20 |
| Portal browser | `in-tour-operations-member-browser.spec.ts` — ITO-BRW-01 |
| Operator browser | `operator-tour-execution.spec.ts` — ITO-B01..B04 |

---

## 10. Idempotency

- Manifest lock: second call → `200` same snapshot (no duplicate rows)
- State transition: same target state → idempotent `200`
- Change PATCH with same body + idempotency key → no duplicate outbox
- Checklist toggle: repeating complete → idempotent

---

## 11. Tenant isolation

All tables FORCE RLS with `tenant_id = current_setting('app.tenant_id')`. Cross-tenant tour id → `404 TOUR_EXECUTION_NOT_FOUND`.
